q and o n
r select q p1 65530
s select q g 65530
t add g 22528
u select q t 65530
v call wfzp1 p0 p1 r 1
w call wfzp1 v p1 s 1
x call wfzp1 w p1 u 1
ret x
end
# Output, one trip per instruction i = p1 (state O: two words per instruction; extras: the list
# p2, the verification state p3, the count table p4 (gets of a local, wfzcnt), np = p5, n = p6). An
# instruction that is removed, or a get that follows a set of its local (the tee takes that pair),
# is kind 0; a set followed by its get is a tee; a set never read is OP 0x1a; a tee never read is
# kind 0. Parameters are untouched.
